ngespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-vk[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Memory webs get their own agent-instruction section[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Generated agent instruction files render three tier-free sections —[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]core memory, memory webs, reference memory — with every memory web [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]inlined as its own numbered subsection of the memory-webs section, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]and no \"Tier 1\"/\"Tier 2\" memory vocabulary anywhere in the repo, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]its docs, its generated output, or its linked repos.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]memory_webs_agents_section.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Web descriptors stop declaring a rendering tier[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]webkind[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]webkind: delete MemoryWeb.rendering_type, stop reading type:/parent: [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]from web descriptors, strip both keys on init, always inline every web [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]descriptor, and update every consumer surface that displayed a web's [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rendering tier.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Tier-free H2 sections and the new Memory Webs section[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]section[dim] · [dim][/dim]after webkind[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]section: rename the generated H2 anchors to Core Memory / Memory Webs / [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Reference Memory, rename the AGENTS template variables, render web [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]descriptors into the new middle section, and teach the AGENTS.md parser [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and TUI rail the three-group shape.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Documentation, memory notes, and regenerated artifacts[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after section[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs: rewrite the tier vocabulary in docs/, the generated sase.md and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]README memory templates, the affected glossary strands, and a new [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]decision record, then regenerate and commit every generated artifact [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]here and in the chezmoi linked repo.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-vk","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-vk.3","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"sase-vk.3"},"source_run_id":"run-2ec16f078d0517af16b516c250b85d3c","started_at":"2026-08-30T09:55:29.028699+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"f52ab15a86653b21ba1e6b17e9de1bbe6a5ea4a3fb1a9366a8e3e58febfd67cc","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-vk.land.w0/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"e0e46a9ea41329d16d1e989fd7e2bbee5b31a44695673f06adb4aece3b217018","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-vk.land.w0/meta.json","size_bytes":469},"prompt":{"digest":"cfd0431ebb618272a0b9ca6c8cd91938059e4ccb321c608aef4418b7b80c7547","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-vk.land.w0/prompt.md","size_bytes":1210},"state":{"digest":"ee9c9c3bb9f2cc1cd4ee5601f82d9c1ceed43f3ff759b1d575333117094c87e6","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-vk.land.w0/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-vk.land.w0","local_name":"